============================================
  Excelsior! BBS TABS 900 Redemption Door
============================================
This  is  a  door  written to use with TABS.
TABS  provides your callers with an easy way
to  purchase  subscriptions by calling a 900
number.   They get charged a flat fee of $10
and  will receive a Subscription ID #.  They
enter  this number in the Excel_TABS program
and gain instant access.
